# 1b. YouTube Educational Videos

Each lesson should link to **2–3 YouTube videos** that reinforce the exact topic. Videos complement images and interactives — they do not replace them.

## Selection Criteria (popularity + quality)

Prefer videos that are:

- **Topic-accurate** — the title and content match the lesson section (not just the chapter theme)
- **Popular** — high view count (typically 100k+ for EN channels; 50k+ for VI channels)
- **Engaging** — clear explanations, good pacing for ages 8–10
- **From trusted edu channels** — not random re-uploads or clickbait

### Trusted channels (English)

| Channel | Best for |
|---|---|
| **Khan Academy** | Arithmetic, fractions, geometry, probability, algebra basics |
| **Math Antics** | Visual intuition: fractions, decimals, negatives, area, volume, patterns |
| **Numberphile** | Enrichment: Fibonacci, Pascal, number curiosity (use sparingly) |

### Trusted channels (Vietnamese)

| Channel | Best for |
|---|---|
| **VietJack Tiểu học** | Phân số, hình học, ôn tập theo SGK lớp 3–5 |
| **VioEdu TV** | Bài giảng tiểu học có cấu trúc |
| **Khan Academy** (vi subs) | Khi chưa có bài VI phù hợp |
| **Thầy Nguyễn Văn Quyền / Cô Giáo Nga** | Phép tính, chia có dư, lớp 3–4 |

Do **not** pick: toy unboxing, generic “ học toán ” compilations, videos with misleading titles, or content above grade level without a simpler alternative.

## Math Video vs Story Video

| Lesson teaches… | Link to… | Do NOT link to… |
|---|---|---|
| Quy luật, công thức, mẫu hình | Explainer that shows the **rule visually** | Vlog or exam tips unrelated to the rule |
| Phép tính (+ − × ÷) | Step-by-step operation video | Calculator tricks for university |
| Phân số, thập phân, % | Fraction/decimal/percent intuition | Cooking video unless lesson is about cooking math |
| Hình học | Shape, area, perimeter, volume demos | Architecture documentary |
| Xác suất, thống kê | Dice, charts, mean/median | Gambling promotion |
| Bài “toán đời sống” (thể thao, chợ…) | Real-world application **in that domain** | Generic arithmetic not tied to the story |

## How to Verify Before Embedding

1. Open the YouTube URL — confirm it plays and matches the lesson topic.
2. Check **view count** and **channel** (sidebar or `yt-dlp --print view_count`).
3. Prefer videos with many comments and long-standing presence (not brand-new uploads with no traction).
4. Use canonical watch URLs: `https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VIDEO_ID`

## How to Embed in Lessons

Place a dedicated section **after core content** (Khám phá / Hoạt động) and **before** Bài tập or Góc cha mẹ:

**Vietnamese:**

```markdown
## Video tham khảo

Xem thêm trên YouTube để củng cố bài học:

1. [Giới thiệu số chẵn số lẻ — Khan Academy](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SFRTTUtAjg4)
2. [Trục số — Math Antics](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RSJOTBJlKNA)
3. [Bảng nhân 3 — Dâu Tây TV](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8yoMIulmEsQ)

*Video: YouTube — kênh giáo dục; nội dung phù hợp lứa tuổi 8–10*
```

**English:**

```markdown
## Watch and Learn

Popular educational videos to reinforce this lesson:

1. [Introduction to even and odd numbers — Khan Academy](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SFRTTUtAjg4)
2. [The Number Line — Math Antics](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RSJOTBJlKNA)

*Videos: YouTube — educational channels suitable for ages 8–10*
```

### Placement checklist per lesson

Aim for **2–3 links** in one `## Video tham khảo` / `## Watch and Learn` block:

1. **Primary** — best topic match (often Khan Academy or Math Antics)
2. **Secondary** — different angle (visual intuition, number line, real-world)
3. **Optional third** — Vietnamese channel for `vi` posts when available; enrichment for `en`

Do **not** scatter video links across the lesson — keep them in one section.

### Anti-patterns (learned from automation)

- Do **not** attach a cherry-basket or unrelated viral clip to a fractions **rule** lesson.
- Do **not** reuse the same three videos for every lesson in a chapter — match each lesson title.
- Do **not** link private, deleted, or age-restricted videos.

Automation: `python3 scripts/add_lesson_videos.py` (curated IDs + topic keywords). Re-run with `--reapply` after updating the video map.

